        {
          "t": "p",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The PiCar-X is an AI-driven self-driving robot car for the Raspberry Pi platform, upon which the Raspberry Pi acts as the control center. The PiCar-X's 2-axis camera module, ultrasonic module, and line tracking modules can provide the functions of color/face/traffic-signs detection, automatic obstacle avoidance, automatic line tracking, etc."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "PiCar-X has two programming languages: Blockly and Python. No matter what language you program in, you'll find detailed steps to teach you everything from configuring the Raspberry Pi to running the relevant example code."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "t": "p",
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "t": "xref",
                    "page": "python/play_with_python",
                    "section": "play-with-python",
                    "v": "Play with Python"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "t": "list",
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "This chapter is for those who enjoy programming in Python or want to learn the Python language."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "To get Picar-X working properly, you must install some libraries first."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "The Raspberry Pi configuration and samples code for the PiCar-X are provided in this chapter."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "An APP - SunFounder Controller is also provided to allow you to remotely control the PiCar-X on your mobile device."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "p",
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "t": "link",
                    "href": "https://docs.sunfounder.com/projects/picar-x-v20/en/latest/ezblock/play_with_ezblock.html",
                    "v": "Play with Ezblock"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "t": "list",
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "In this section, you will use a Blockly based APP, Ezblock Studio, which, like Scratch, allows you to drag and drop blocks to make Picar-X move."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "It is required to reinstall the SD card with the operating system we provide with pre-installed Ezblock environment before programming. It is recommended to use a new or unused TF card for this section."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "Ezblock Studio is available for nearly all types of devices, including Macs, PCs, and Androids."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  [
                    {
                      "t": "p",
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "t": "text",
                          "v": "Ezblock Studio is a good choice if you are 6-12 years old, or don't have programming skills, or want to test Picar-X quickly."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ]
          ]
